| 4/4 cm  | Dm7 G7 | 7/8 AbMaj7:3 G7:4 | 3/4 Gm7b5:2 C7:1 |
[turn]
| 4/4 Fm7 | Gm7b5 C7 | Fm7 | Bm7b5 E7 |
[choir]
| 5/8 A7  | G7alt | 2/4 cm7 Abb9 | 4/4 Dm7b5 G7b9 |

